flowchart TD
    META["Authoritative approved Fabric SQL metadata"]
    META --> MACRO["Smaller domain/workflow Airflow DAGs<br/>Read-only immutable orchestration snapshots"]
    MACRO --> TASK["One independently executable ProcessingTask record<br/>Generic stage PySpark notebook; justified specialization allowed"]
    META --> ORDER["Approved storage: ONE ordered JSON function array per task<br/>Registered DataFrame functions and validated per-function parameters"]
    ORDER --> TASK
    RESOURCES["Framework/stage defaults and task overrides<br/>Logical notebook, environment and separate compute refs"]
    RESOURCES --> TASK
    TASK --> INPUT["Read pinned committed input versions"]
    INPUT --> F1["DataFrame.transform: registered function 1"]
    F1 --> F2["DataFrame.transform: registered function 2"]
    F2 --> FN["DataFrame.transform: remaining functions in configured order"]
    FN --> VALIDATE["Framework output validation and idempotent write"]
    VALIDATE --> COMMIT["Record committed output and coverage"]
    COMMIT --> WAKE["Readiness event; periodic reconciliation fallback<br/>Metadata rechecks all dependencies, then initiates Airflow work"]
    PURE["Business functions take/return DataFrames<br/>No framework instrumentation or source/target I/O inside functions"]
    PURE -. Applies to .-> F1
    PURE -. Applies to .-> F2
    PURE -. Applies to .-> FN
    NOTE["Function micro-order is not the normalized TaskInput/producer graph<br/>Legacy step profiling/history and physical metadata schemas need reconciliation"]
    NOTE -. Boundary .-> MACRO
